{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Booty Battler</strong>: An auto-battler pirate adventure in the pursuit of loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, manage and upgrade your pirate crew as you fight your way through the treacherous seas in Booty Battler! Discover rare treasures, buried caches, cast spells and collect loot in this auto-battler adventure as you attempt to cross the archipelago with the GigaStorm in pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need a sense for strategy, quick thinking, the greed of a true pirate, and perhaps a bit of luck to survive the seafaring journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble the crew:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell units at each battle, find synergistic combos and grow stronger as your encounters are met with increasing resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/26d341151ef158513ea5bf13d67df0c4.poster.avif?t=1760060775\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/26d341151ef158513ea5bf13d67df0c4.webm?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/26d341151ef158513ea5bf13d67df0c4.mp4?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart a course:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your routes of locations to visit to maximize your chances of success. These locations could contain battles for loot, hidden caches of cursed treasures, random encounters and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/0b0d8db0590ac54237b84801185a25e4.poster.avif?t=1760060775\" width=482 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/0b0d8db0590ac54237b84801185a25e4.webm?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/0b0d8db0590ac54237b84801185a25e4.mp4?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Battles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From among the pirates you have collected, only 6 may participate in combat. These booty battlers will fight tooth and nail for any chance at loot, and will do so of their own accord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/3eb1d22d9e02f332a020c2b791e8e7dc.poster.avif?t=1760060775\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/3eb1d22d9e02f332a020c2b791e8e7dc.webm?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/3eb1d22d9e02f332a020c2b791e8e7dc.mp4?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and scoot:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your selected crew fights, a flurry of combat power-ups and treasures falls from the sky into the sea to be collected by your ship. Prioritize the loot that matters most before it sinks beneath the waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/1e19c178e4306911d8a7c4f4019ddcd7.poster.avif?t=1760060775\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/1e19c178e4306911d8a7c4f4019ddcd7.webm?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/extras/1e19c178e4306911d8a7c4f4019ddcd7.mp4?t=1760060775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506150?t=1760060775","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/d5dd6ec3b753f35e38ef0fc4be82b9a5867e7ea1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760060775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/4fa80a2120eb0721e3e9bd1f888a30c69b782e2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760060775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506150/4fa80a2120eb0721e3e9bd1f888a30c69b782e2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760060775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Booty Battler</strong>: An auto-battler pirate adventure in the pursuit of loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, manage and upgrade your pirate crew as you fight your way through the treacherous seas in Booty Battler! Discover rare treasures, buried caches, cast spells and collect loot in this auto-battler adventure as you attempt to cross the archipelago with the GigaStorm in pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need a sense for strategy, quick thinking, the greed of a true pirate, and perhaps a bit of luck to survive the seafaring journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble the crew:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell units at each battle, find synergistic com